            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Clears values from a spreadsheet. The caller must specify the spreadsheet ID and range. Only values are cleared -- all other properties of the cell (such as formatting, data validation, etc..) are kept."
